# Accept Teleportation
# Phase play, serverbound (C->S), packet id 0x00 (0)
# Docs: 09 §3.2 row 0x00; 05c 0x00
# Stated inputs: teleport id 1 (the first Player Position of the connection, 09 §3.2), applied position = spawn
#   feet (4.5, 54.0, 8.5), yaw -90.0, pitch 0.0 (as play-s2c-49-player-position.hex, standin §5.2).

00                                                 # packet id 0x00 (VarInt)
01                                                 # Teleport id: VarInt 1
40 12 00 00 00 00 00 00                            # X: Double 4.5
40 4b 00 00 00 00 00 00                            # Y: Double 54.0
40 21 00 00 00 00 00 00                            # Z: Double 8.5
c2 b4 00 00                                        # Yaw: Float -90.0
00 00 00 00                                        # Pitch: Float 0.0
